msgstr "上移"

#: frontend/php/git/admin/index.php:164
msgid "Move down"
msgstr "下移"

#: frontend/php/git/admin/index.php:170
msgid ""
"Path to a file like <code><var>branch</var>:<var>directory</var>/<var>file</var></code>.\n"
"The file will be displayed on the &ldquo;about page&rdquo;\n"
"of the repository.  Savane filter passes files with names ending in\n"
"&ldquo;.html&rdquo; unmodified; in other files, HTML special\n"
"characters are replaced with HTML entities, and the result\n"
"is enclosed in a <code>&lt;pre&gt;</code> element.  For more info,\n"
"dig into cgitrc (5)."
msgstr ""
"指向類似 <code><var>branch</var>:<var>directory</var>/<var>file</var></code> 的檔案路徑。\n"
"該檔案會顯示在儲存庫的 &ldquo;about page&rdquo; 上。Savane 篩選器會原樣傳遞名稱以\n"
"&ldquo;.html&rdquo; 結尾的檔案；在其他檔案中，HTML 特殊字元\n"
"會被取代為 HTML 實體，結果會以 <code>&lt;pre&gt;</code> 元素包覆。如需更多資訊，\n"
"請查閱 cgitrc (5)。"

